    "en": {
      "trackName": "TT Mahjong Watch - Multi Modes",
      "description": "Play seven Mahjong modes plus free tile-matching on iPhone and Apple Watch.\n\n• Popular Mahjong: free classic four-player mode with flowers\n• Battle to the End: Sichuan rules with Swap Three and a void suit\n• Blood River: keep winning until the wall is exhausted\n• Riichi Mahjong: riichi, dora, yaku, and a complete dead wall\n• Guangdong Mahjong: push-down hu, big/small hands, and horse tiles\n• Guiyang Zhuoji: flip chickens and the Dou Passport\n• Red Dragon Mahjong: Red Dragons as wild tiles\n\nPopular Mahjong and tile-matching are free; each of the six premium modes includes three trial plays. Weekly and monthly auto-renewable subscriptions and a one-time lifetime purchase may be offered. Localized prices and billing periods appear before purchase. Manage or cancel subscriptions in App Store account settings.\n\nTerms of Use: https://gamepark.online/mahjong/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://gamepark.online/mahjong/privacy",
